9 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186493405 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "08b31b5f-4d45-56bb-9d27-10f181056843" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186493445 #edb/ref 1080 "I only" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186493445 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186493445 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "1f5ebfbd-349c-5710-ab1d-bffdb6d4d025" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186493447 #edb/ref 1080 "II and III only" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186493447 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186493447 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "21c0505d-1159-59fb-ba8b-2bd5ac4199de" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186493623 #edb/ref 1080 "III only" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186493623 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186493623 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "94c66a12-70a7-529f-ba21-ac7f034b13c8" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186493752 #edb/ref 1080 "I and III only" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186493752 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186493752 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "e4ada2c6-ebf0-5d58-9a21-8f0d7d2bddb7" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186493831 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186493405 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186493831 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186493445 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186493831 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186493447 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186493831 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186493623 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186493831 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186493752 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186493831 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186493831 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186493831 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186493447 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186493831 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "6457d0d0-1968-5324-849a-7bcaae3a3d7b" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186493969 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186493831 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186493969 #edb/ref 1069 "q-95286" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186493969 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186493969 #edb/ref 1071 "Which of the following statements are true?\n\nI. Any $6\\times 5$ matrix $A$ has at most $6$ distinct singular values.\n\nII. Any $8\\times 9$ matrix $A$ has at most $9$ distinct singular values.\n\nIII. The matrix $A=[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -1\\end{aligned}]$ has at most two non-negative distinct singular values." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186493969 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "dfba6eb1-d0b6-5cbc-ac16-d682a2e1cc93" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186493969 #edb/ref 1074 "The singular values of the matrix $A$ are the square roots of the eigenvalues of the matrix ${A}^{T}\\,A.$ \n\nWith that in mind, let's examine our statements.\n\n- Statement I is false. Since $A$ is a $6\\times 5$ matrix and ${A}^{T}$ is a $5\\times 6$ matrix, ${A}^{T}\\,A$ must be a $5\\times 5$ matrix: \n\n$$\n{{A}^{T}}_{5\\times 6}\\times {A}_{6\\times 5}={{A}^{T}\\,A}_{5\\times 5}\n$$\n\nHence, $A$ has at most $5$ distinct singular values.\n\n- Statement II is true. Indeed, since $A$ is a $8\\times 9$ matrix and ${A}^{T}$ is a $9\\times 8$ matrix, ${A}^{T}\\,A$ must be a $9\\times 9$ matrix: \n\n$$\n{{A}^{T}}_{9\\times 8}\\times {A}_{8\\times 9}={{A}^{T}\\,A}_{9\\times 9}\n$$\n\nHence, $A$ has at most $9$ distinct singular values.\n\n- Statement III is true.  Indeed, all singular values of any matrix are non-negative.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II and III only.\"" #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
